{"id":"bc99cdeced2b42c3","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-cfg-tree-derivation-equivalence.md","title":"推导、最左推导与树产出的对应","display":"thm-cfg-tree-derivation-equivalence — 推导、最左推导与树产出的对应","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-cfg-tree-derivation-equivalence","aliases":["73-thm-cfg-tree-derivation-equivalence"],"display":"thm-cfg-tree-derivation-equivalence — 推导、最左推导与树产出的对应","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-tree-yield]]","[[73-df-cfg-derivation]]","[[73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§5.1–5.2, print pp. 171–194; PDF pp. 193–216; local typed grammar/tree interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorem 4.1, pp. 84–87; scans 92–95","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":5},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-cfg-tree-derivation-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-cfg-tree-derivation-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cfg-tree-derivation-equivalence — 推导、最左推导与树产出的对应"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4b4cb7350d4f0995\" href=\"?note=4b4cb7350d4f0995\" title=\"73-df-cfg-tree-yield\">73-df-cfg-tree-yield</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76137a7886cfb97a\" href=\"?note=76137a7886cfb97a\" title=\"73-df-cfg-derivation\">73-df-cfg-derivation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c57bbf0a680e199a\" href=\"?note=c57bbf0a680e199a\" title=\"73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation\">73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§5.1–5.2, print pp. 171–194; PDF pp. 193–216; local typed grammar/tree interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 4.1, pp. 84–87; scans 92–95"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\">\\(\\alpha\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\)</span>。树与产出见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4b4cb7350d4f0995\" href=\"?note=4b4cb7350d4f0995\" title=\"73-df-cfg-tree-yield\">73-df-cfg-tree-yield</a>，一般和最左推导见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76137a7886cfb97a\" href=\"?note=76137a7886cfb97a\" title=\"73-df-cfg-derivation\">73-df-cfg-derivation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c57bbf0a680e199a\" href=\"?note=c57bbf0a680e199a\" title=\"73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation\">73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}derivation\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\langle A\\rangle\\Rightarrow_G^*\\alpha\\leftrightarrow\\exists t\\in\\{u:\\operatorname{ParseTree}_G(u,A)\\}\\;\\operatorname{Yield}_G(t)=\\alpha\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}derivation\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\langle A\\rangle\\Rightarrow_G^*\\alpha\\leftrightarrow\\exists t\\in\\{u:\\operatorname{ParseTree}_G(u,A)\\}\\;\\operatorname{Yield}_G(t)=\\alpha\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}derivation\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(\\langle S\\rangle\\Rightarrow_G^*w\\leftrightarrow\\langle S\\rangle\\Rightarrow_{G,\\mathsf{lm}}^*w)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}tree\\text{-}derivation\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(\\langle S\\rangle\\Rightarrow_G^*w\\leftrightarrow\\langle S\\rangle\\Rightarrow_{G,\\mathsf{lm}}^*w)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐步推导时在被替换的非终结符叶上嫁接一层产生式，得到树。反向对内部节点数归纳，按子节点从左到右完成各子树；对完整终结词可始终展开最左的非终结符。部分句型则不声称一定有最左推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-tree-yield","status":"resolved","id":"4b4cb7350d4f0995","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-tree-yield]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"76137a7886cfb97a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-leftmost-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"c57bbf0a680e199a","anchor":"ref-3","targe